      "I need a gentler way out of this."
    ],
    "mate": [
      "Checkmate. I hope that did not feel too harsh.",
      "That is the end. Thank you for staying with it."
    ],
    "draw": [
      "Maybe neither of us needed to break today.",
      "A draw can still be a peaceful answer."
    ],
    "opponentRepeating": [
      "You keep returning to that piece. Is something there worrying you?",
      "That path keeps coming back. I should listen to it."
    ],
    "underPressure": [
