      "I can feel the pressure. I just need one safe step."
    ],
    "openingDeviation": [
      "Oh, we are leaving the familiar path. That is okay.",
      "Different route, same goal: keep everyone safe."
    ],
    "failedPlan": [
      "That did not help the way I hoped. Let me try another angle.",
      "I misread the feeling of that position. I can adjust."
    ],
    "retaliation": [
